    "message": "With oak and terracotta already bringing warmth, keep the walls calm:\n\n- **Farrow & Ball “Shaded White”** — soft, slightly grey; the safest choice.\n- **Little Greene “Slaked Lime – Mid”** — warmer, lovely in evening light.\n- If you want colour: **“Treron”** (muted green) on one wall only.\n\nTest A4 swatches on two walls for a few days — north light will make the greens look cooler.",
